#
##   Blacklist
#

## Global Convention
# > .* files and dirs would be ignored globally, add targeted exception when needed
.*

## Tooling Output Dirs
# > conventional names ignored globally, add targeted exception when needed
*.log
*cache*/
coverage/
log/
logs/
report/
temp/
tmp/

## Package Build Root Output
/build/
/dist/
/Formula/
/out/
/releases/

## Src Output Root Dir
/output/*
/storage

## Symlinks Escaped .*
# > repositories that own real copies re-include them in Repo-specific Entries
/AGENTS.md
/cspell.config.yaml
/Dockerfile
/justfile
harnesses/claude/skills

#
##   Whitelist
#

## Git Metadata Files
# > explicit names keep .git and .github ignored by file walkers too
!.gitattributes
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep

## .github for copilot configs and github actions
# > `.github` is kept ignored, use `git add -f` to track github action workflows

## Agent Discovery Root Exceptions
# > keep /.agents, /.vscode symlinks ignored, but make their content discoverable
!/.agents/
!/.vscode/

#
##   Repo-specific Entries
#

## Real Config File Exceptions
!/.editorconfig
!/.markdownlint.yaml
!/.pre-commit-config.yaml
!/cspell.config.yaml
